1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,649
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,691 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,359
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,401 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,929
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,971 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,309
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,351 --> 00:00:29,839
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,881 --> 00:00:31,329
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,371 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,179
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,221 --> 00:00:36,789
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,831 --> 00:00:38,239
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,281 --> 00:00:42,439
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,481 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:46,320
Thank you, Young Master Rong.

17
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:48,640
Sir.

18
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:50,350
Two orders of buns
and two orders of tofu pudding.

19
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:51,070
Coming right up.

20
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,790
Careful.

21
00:00:59,670 --> 00:01:00,350
Young Master Rong.

22
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,179
These tofu buns

23
00:01:02,221 --> 00:01:03,179
are a Fancheng specialty.

24
00:01:03,221 --> 00:01:04,230
You won't find them anywhere else.

25
00:01:05,350 --> 00:01:06,040
Try one.

26
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:08,379
I never knew you were kind and lovely,

27
00:01:08,421 --> 00:01:09,150
always ready to help others,

28
00:01:09,350 --> 00:01:11,070
and knew how ordinary people live.

29
00:01:11,590 --> 00:01:12,480
To tell you the truth,

30
00:01:12,710 --> 00:01:14,310
I also support many orphans.

31
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,129
After breakfast,

32
00:01:16,171 --> 00:01:17,710
I'll take you to see them at school.

33
00:01:18,510 --> 00:01:19,310
All right.

34
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,760
Try the tofu pudding while it's hot.

35
00:01:24,230 --> 00:01:25,230
Careful. It's hot.

36
00:01:28,870 --> 00:01:29,560
Is it good?

37
00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:35,980
=Episode 19=

38
00:01:41,790 --> 00:01:43,230
You're early again, Young Master Rong.

39
00:01:43,430 --> 00:01:45,590
Ms. Lu and I are going boating today.

40
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:46,680
This way, please.

41
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,950
You're getting earlier every day,
Young Master Rong

42
00:02:08,630 --> 00:02:10,030
The spring weather is lovely today.

43
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:12,280
Ms. Lu and I are going camping
outside the city.

44
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:13,910
This way, please.

45
00:02:40,150 --> 00:02:42,630
You didn't get here until after noon
today, Young Master Rong.

46
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,310
Yesterday's camping wore Ms. Lu out,

47
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,960
so I let her sleep in.

48
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,430
This afternoon, we're going

49
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,910
to Catherine Cafe for a Napoleon pastry.

50
00:03:14,470 --> 00:03:15,560
Young Master Rong.

51
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:16,870
Try this.

52
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,430
Father and I both love it.

53
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:23,870
It's delicious.

54
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,000
I can do it myself.

55
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,030
Thank you, Young Master Rong.

56
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:05,430
Why did you stop eating?

57
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:08,680
I'm done.

58
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:09,590
I don't want to gain weight.

59
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,430
Then have some coffee.

60
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,430
Here. Careful.

61
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,560
Thank you, Young Master Rong.

62
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,600
You're welcome.

63
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:43,000
Did you forget something,
Young Master Rong?

64
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:44,720
My handkerchief is missing.

65
00:04:44,830 --> 00:04:47,120
I may have left it in the cafe.

66
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,160
Young Master Rong,
I'll go get it for you.

67
00:04:50,630 --> 00:04:51,049
No need.

68
00:04:51,091 --> 00:04:51,870
You wouldn't recognize it.

69
00:04:53,310 --> 00:04:54,600
Wait here, Ms. Lu.

70
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:16,630
Ms. Lu.

71
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,560
Don't you think you're taking
this act too far?

72
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,510
I think it's fine.

73
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:25,360
That's called affection with restraint.

74
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:33,310
Ms. Lu.

75
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:35,630
You call this affection with restraint?

76
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,680
Commander He.

77
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:41,800
I think you're jealous,

78
00:05:41,950 --> 00:05:43,160
but I can't prove it.

79
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,240
Young Master Rong.

80
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:09,430
Did you find it?

81
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:10,720
I may have lost it.

82
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:15,510
Never mind. Let's go.

83
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:25,809
Who knew

84
00:06:25,851 --> 00:06:27,310
you were such a little glutton?

85
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,720
You ate your lipstick right off.

86
00:06:46,310 --> 00:06:47,480
Don't be upset.

87
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:50,510
At least she let you kiss her

88
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:52,000
a little longer.

89
00:06:54,070 --> 00:06:54,729
Since you're in such good spirits,

90
00:06:54,771 --> 00:06:55,289
walk back.

91
00:06:55,331 --> 00:06:55,800
Go.

92
00:06:59,430 --> 00:07:00,870
I wasn't wrong, was I?

93
00:07:09,510 --> 00:07:10,600
Careful, Ms. Lu.

94
00:07:27,190 --> 00:07:28,160
Tomorrow morning,

95
00:07:29,070 --> 00:07:30,430
I'll ask the Governor
for your hand in marriage.

96
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:34,190
We've only known each other a few days.

97
00:07:34,950 --> 00:07:36,360
Isn't this too sudden?

98
00:07:36,950 --> 00:07:38,040
Only a few days,

99
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,190
yet I'll remember them all my life.

100
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:43,270
It doesn't feel sudden to me.

101
00:07:43,830 --> 00:07:46,160
If I don't act fast,
someone else might beat me to it.

102
00:07:51,750 --> 00:07:54,000
But Father only just found me.

103
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:56,680
He says he wants to keep me close
and dote on me for two more years.

104
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,830
What if he refuses?

105
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:03,560
Don't worry.

106
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:05,920
The governor needs supplies
from my father.

107
00:08:06,430 --> 00:08:07,929
If I persuade Father

108
00:08:07,971 --> 00:08:09,310
to approve the deal,

109
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,360
he'll agree to our marriage.

110
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,680
So you mean to marry

111
00:08:29,430 --> 00:08:32,480
my daughter Yutang, Young Master Rong?

112
00:08:35,390 --> 00:08:37,150
Ms. Lu and I are in love.

113
00:08:37,390 --> 00:08:38,270
We only wish we'd met sooner.

114
00:08:38,870 --> 00:08:40,270
Didn't you say yourself

115
00:08:40,790 --> 00:08:42,390
that fate brought me to you both?

116
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:45,320
If Ms. Lu and I marry,

117
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:48,360
and our families strike a deal,

118
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,200
wouldn't that be fate twice over?

119
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,150
Governor.

120
00:09:06,550 --> 00:09:08,840
You said you had
a top-secret assignment for me.

121
00:09:09,270 --> 00:09:10,120
What is it?

122
00:09:10,550 --> 00:09:11,240
No rush.

123
00:09:11,910 --> 00:09:12,889
There's something

124
00:09:12,931 --> 00:09:13,840
you need to know first.

125
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:17,510
Yutang isn't my biological daughter.

126
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,630
What?

127
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:22,630
It's all thanks to that wretched son
of mine.

128
00:09:23,030 --> 00:09:25,270
Still, Su Yutang is quite pragmatic.

129
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:28,200
Having her as a daughter suits me fine.

130
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:29,819
Besides,

131
00:09:29,861 --> 00:09:33,120
she and Rong Muxian are in love.

132
00:09:33,270 --> 00:09:34,750
That works to our advantage.

133
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:37,750
You think ahead, Governor.

134
00:09:38,790 --> 00:09:39,670
I'm impressed.

135
00:09:40,630 --> 00:09:41,440
Jingchen.

136
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:43,459
You're capable

137
00:09:43,501 --> 00:09:44,240
and loyal.

138
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:47,080
Though you're not my own blood,

139
00:09:47,630 --> 00:09:49,000
right now,

140
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:51,390
you're the person I trust most.

141
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,200
This is...?

142
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:59,390
The Lu family's ancestral treasure map.

143
00:09:59,630 --> 00:10:00,320
Tomorrow,

144
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,750
follow the map
and retrieve the treasure.

145
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:04,030
Bring it back
to the Governor's Residence.

146
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:06,510
Use part of it as the deposit.

147
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,840
Have Yutang take it to Lancheng.

148
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,030
Bring the rest back here

149
00:10:11,150 --> 00:10:12,600
and hide it under my bed.

150
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:15,550
This is a top-secret assignment.

151
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:17,550
There can be no loose ends.

152
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,579
(I never expected)

153
00:10:20,621 --> 00:10:22,030
(Iron Leopard himself would hand me)

154
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,960
(the treasure map in the end.)

155
00:10:25,870 --> 00:10:26,550
(No.)

156
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,720
(This could still be another trap.)

157
00:10:29,390 --> 00:10:30,670
(I'd better test him.)

158
00:10:32,550 --> 00:10:33,360
Governor.

159
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:36,720
Could Su Yutang be a problem?

160
00:10:36,910 --> 00:10:38,529
Do you really trust her to leave

161
00:10:38,571 --> 00:10:39,790
with Rong Muxian and the deposit?

162
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:42,390
That's why I'm sending you
to escort the bride.

163
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:45,480
Su Yutang is smart.

164
00:10:45,630 --> 00:10:47,270
After what happened last time,

165
00:10:47,510 --> 00:10:49,510
I'm sure she doesn't want to stay here

166
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,270
and face me every day either.

167
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:56,360
The Rong family is her best way out.

168
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:59,459
And from what I've seen,

169
00:10:59,501 --> 00:11:01,150
her feelings for him aren't an act.

170
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,630
If she's up to something,

171
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,790
fake daughter or not,

172
00:11:07,550 --> 00:11:08,910
even if she were my real daughter,

173
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:12,200
I wouldn't spare her.

174
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:16,790
I will not fail you, Governor.

175
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,390
The day we've waited for
is finally here.

176
00:11:28,510 --> 00:11:29,720
Iron Leopard's plan is

177
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:31,670
to give Rong Muxian part of the deposit.

178
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,150
Once they return to Lancheng

179
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,480
and complete the wedding rites,

180
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:38,030
Rong Yunhai will ship the goods here.

181
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:40,790
We'll pay for them in installments.

182
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,299
The old man

183
00:11:42,341 --> 00:11:44,840
is letting him leave
with his daughter and the deposit?

184
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,510
Isn't he afraid of losing both?

185
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:48,550
It's only a deposit.

186
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,960
Rong Yunhai wouldn't stoop that low.

187
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:52,600
As for the daughter...

188
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,320
she isn't really his.

189
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:58,480
He also put me in charge
of escorting the bride

190
00:11:58,750 --> 00:12:01,720
so I can size up the Rong family,

191
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:02,870
just in case.

192
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:07,750
What happens after we dig up
the gold bars?

193
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:14,080
He told me to keep them
under his bed for now.

194
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,600
But you know what he's like.

195
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:19,080
He never fully trusts anyone.

196
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:20,630
He'll probably move them

197
00:12:20,750 --> 00:12:22,670
so only he knows where they are.

198
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,390
The gold bars are heavy too.

199
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,720
They're hard to move.

200
00:12:27,270 --> 00:12:29,550
I think they'll stay
at the Governor's Residence.

201
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,120
All right.

202
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:33,249
We'll follow your original plan

203
00:12:33,291 --> 00:12:34,200
and split into two teams.

204
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,489
Staff Officer Chen,
I'll leave the details to you.

205
00:12:36,531 --> 00:12:37,000
Come.

206
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,080
You're about to be a bride, Ms. Lu.

207
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,150
No sighing.

208
00:12:53,630 --> 00:12:55,670
I thought I could wear a wedding dress

209
00:12:55,750 --> 00:12:57,240
and have a Western wedding.

210
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:01,840
The Rongs of Lancheng are traditional.

211
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:04,630
Their family has been in business
since the Song dynasty.

212
00:13:04,750 --> 00:13:06,720
They care most about old traditions.

213
00:13:07,030 --> 00:13:08,059
As the bride,

214
00:13:08,101 --> 00:13:09,670
of course, you should wear
a bright red wedding gown.

215
00:13:09,750 --> 00:13:12,099
Wearing all white would be bad luck.

216
00:13:12,141 --> 00:13:14,320
Don't overthink it, Ms. Lu.

217
00:13:16,030 --> 00:13:16,720
I know.

218
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,510
I was just saying.

219
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:40,470
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

220
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:45,859
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

221
00:13:45,901 --> 00:13:48,530
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

222
00:13:50,030 --> 00:13:51,589
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

223
00:13:51,631 --> 00:13:55,730
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

224
00:13:56,270 --> 00:14:01,680
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

225
00:14:03,270 --> 00:14:06,589
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

226
00:14:06,631 --> 00:14:09,939
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

227
00:14:09,981 --> 00:14:12,499
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

228
00:14:12,541 --> 00:14:15,520
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

229
00:14:15,790 --> 00:14:22,040
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

230
00:14:22,530 --> 00:14:25,839
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

231
00:14:25,881 --> 00:14:29,069
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

232
00:14:29,111 --> 00:14:35,839
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

233
00:14:35,881 --> 00:14:39,089
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

234
00:14:39,131 --> 00:14:42,529
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

235
00:14:42,571 --> 00:14:44,690
♪Boundless♪
